<div class="page-container py-section-sm">
  <div class="max-w-prose space-y-8">
    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-about">
      <h2 id="privacy-about" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">About this policy</h2>
      <p>This policy explains how {{ site.name }} ("we", "us") collects, uses and protects personal information when you visit our website or contact us. We handle personal information in line with the Australian Privacy Principles.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-collect">
      <h2 id="privacy-collect" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you send an enquiry or request a quote, we collect the details you give us, such as your name, phone number, email address, the address where the work is needed, and information about your trees.</p>
      <p>When you use our website, we also collect general information about your visit, such as pages viewed, the type of device and browser you use, and how you arrived at our site. This is collected using cookies and similar technology.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-use">
      <h2 id="privacy-use" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your details to respond to your enquiry, prepare quotes, arrange and carry out work, and keep records of the work we've done. We use website information to understand how our site is used and to measure how well our advertising works.</p>
      <p>We don't sell your personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-third-parties">
      <h2 id="privacy-third-parties" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Services we use</h2>
      <p>Our online enquiry form is provided by JotForm, which stores submitted details on its servers, which may be outside Australia. We use Google services (including Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics and Google Ads) to measure website use and advertising. These providers handle information under their own privacy policies.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-cookies">
      <h2 id="privacy-cookies" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Cookies</h2>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Our website will still work if you do.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="privacy-access">
      <h2 id="privacy-access" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Access, correction and complaints</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see or correct the personal information we hold about you, or raise a privacy concern, by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="text-primary underline">{{ site.email }}</a> or writing to {{ site.postalAddress.street }}, {{ site.postalAddress.locality }} {{ site.postalAddress.region }} {{ site.postalAddress.postcode }}. If you're not happy with our response, you can contact the <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/" class="text-primary underline">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner</a>.</p>
    </section>
